			"notes": "AutoSleep 1.0.0: sleep in the nearest bed at night (client-side, Fabric 1.21.11)\n\nAt night the mod uses the nearest bed exactly as a right click would, so it works on servers without the mod. A bed out of reach is walked to with Baritone 1.17.0, bundled in the jar and set never to break or place blocks. Night is day time 12523 to 23477, when a clear overworld sky lets players sleep; beds are skipped where the bed rule makes them explode. The client GameTest records each step with a step panel and a day/night panel."
